@startuml
title React Native New Architecture (Fabric/JSI) (View -> UIView / android.view.View)

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true

package "JavaScript Realm" {
  [React Components (JSX)] as JSX2
  [Reconciler (JS)] as Reconciler2
  [JSI (C++ API)] as JSI
}

package "Renderer" {
  [Fabric Renderer] as Fabric
  [Shadow Tree] as ShadowTree2
  [Yoga (Layout)] as Yoga2
}

package "Native Realm" {
  [UIManager (Fabric)] as UIManager2
  [TurboModules (C++/ObjC/Java)] as TurboModules
  [CodeGen Specs] as Codegen

  package "iOS" {
    [UIViewManager (Fabric)] as F_iOS_VM
    [UIView (UIKit)] as F_UIView
  }

  package "Android" {
    [ViewManager (Fabric)] as F_And_VM
    [android.view.View] as F_AView
  }
}

JSX2 -down-> Reconciler2 : render()
Reconciler2 -down-> Fabric : commit work via JSI
JSI -down-> Fabric : direct C++ calls (no JSON bridge)
Fabric -down-> ShadowTree2 : create/update nodes
ShadowTree2 -down-> Yoga2 : layout calculation
Yoga2 -up-> Fabric : layout results
Fabric -down-> UIManager2 : mount/schedule mutations
UIManager2 -right-> F_iOS_VM : create/update
UIManager2 -right-> F_And_VM : create/update
F_iOS_VM -down-> F_UIView
F_And_VM -down-> F_AView

JSI -right-> TurboModules : native functions (synchronous/async)
Codegen -down-> TurboModules : typed interface bindings
@enduml
